{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/GIf_hero\u0301is.gif?t=1745528747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A third-person 3D Roguelite like you've never seen before! Madora raises the challenge level by bringing a different map perspective and character view. Explore dark forests and lands as you challenge enemies and protect the world of Madora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/Gif_Skills.gif?t=1745528747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our system of active and passive skills, in Madora each skill has more than one unique effect, and can be allocated as active or passive skills, thus making the possibilities for combinations exponential. Believe me, you will need the best combination possible to face \u00c1rodam, the lord of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/MAPA_SEM_LOGO.png?t=1745528747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the World of Madora, a mythological land with Brazilian inspirations, where Good tries to contain the advance of evil and guarantee peace. Adventure through volcanoes, mountains, forests, seas and other inspiring landscapes to take your roguelite experience to another level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400300?t=1745528747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400300?t=1745528747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/21d59ac4d44fc7496310626d1d118d95d96f4846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745528747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/21d59ac4d44fc7496310626d1d118d95d96f4846/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745528747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3512400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/GIf_hero\u0301is.gif?t=1745528747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A third-person 3D Roguelite like you've never seen before! Madora raises the challenge level by bringing a different map perspective and character view. Explore dark forests and lands as you challenge enemies and protect the world of Madora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/Gif_Skills.gif?t=1745528747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our system of active and passive skills, in Madora each skill has more than one unique effect, and can be allocated as active or passive skills, thus making the possibilities for combinations exponential. Believe me, you will need the best combination possible to face \u00c1rodam, the lord of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/MAPA_SEM_LOGO.png?t=1745528747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the World of Madora, a mythological land with Brazilian in